    <shape type="text" topLeftX="700" topLeftY="258" width="184" height="104"><content textType="body" fontSize="12" color="rgb(71,85,105)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top"><p><span bold="true" color="rgb(0,28,84)">AI 整理服务（旁支）</span></p><p>LlmAiAdapter 走 OpenAI 兼容接口优先；未配置密钥或调用失败，自动回退 RuleAiOrganizer 规则引擎；来源写入 ai_log。</p></content></shape>

